# stop: exit
# max-insns: 3_000_000_000
# bane-profile (CoCo 3 port, profile session like walk-profile: not a golden): the user's saved game F (slot F of the shipped
# SAVE folder) in the Temple of Bane's nave at (11,9), search mode. One step east the party finds the third trapdoor
# (12,9) with this clock (the CoCo's seed at the main menu is the oracle's with it); opening it and taking a hand axe
# brings High Priest Mace and 55 orcs. Quick combat (a run of Q keys, as council-guards) until the party falls and the game ends (the original: 897 M instructions).
# The same script as ports/dos/sessions/bane-battle.keys apart from the clock (Tandy video draws other dice).
clock 12:00:16.58
wheel
wait 20
key L
wait 20
key F
wait 300
key UP
wait 20
shot trapdoor
key O
wait 60
shot opened
key ENTER
wait 60
shot treasure
wait 100
press T                  # the chest animates: press with long waits, not key (tests/sessions/README.md)
wait 100
shot loot
key T
wait 30
shot took
key E
wait 100
press E
wait 100
shot treasure-left
press N
wait 100
shot attack
